"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en/Localization_and_Plurals>`_, das die "
"\"Plural Rules and Families\" aus der `GNU-gettext-Dokumentation "
"<http://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/manual/html_node/gettext_150.html#Plural-"
"forms>`_ verwendet."
